</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="35972620" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;35972620&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Identidade visual consistente</strong>: Escolha cores, fontes e logotipos que reflitam a personalidade e valores da sua marca.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="35972620" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;35972620&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Landing pages eficazes</strong>: Desenvolva páginas de entrada que expliquem seus serviços de forma clara e atraiam potenciais clientes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading3" data-header="3" data-margin-bottom="14.04pt" data-margin-top="14.04pt" data-hd-info="3" data-line-height="1.2">Definindo Metas de Negócio Claras<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocwoyyyx7zly1i&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_6hkzdwdgxm5y&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_6hkzdwdgxm5y"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocwoyyyx7zly1i&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_6hkzdwdgxm5y&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_6hkzdwdgxm5y"> </span></h3>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Antes de iniciar sua estratégia de digitalização, defina<strong> metas claras e mensuráveis</strong>. Quer aumentar sua base de clientes ou reduzir o tempo gasto em tarefas administrativas? Ao definir suas metas desde o início, você terá um caminho claro a seguir.</p>

<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading3" data-header="3" data-margin-bottom="14.04pt" data-margin-top="14.04pt" data-hd-info="3" data-line-height="1.2">Estrutura de Atendimento ao Cliente Digital<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocu2g29fe8n5u3&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_202gyhbfcupe&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_202gyhbfcupe"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocu2g29fe8n5u3&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_202gyhbfcupe&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_202gyhbfcupe"> </span></h3>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Uma estrutura eficiente de<strong> atendimento ao cliente</strong> é fundamental para manter seus clientes satisfeitos e garantir a retenção a longo prazo. A automação é sua melhor aliada nessa missão. Ferramentas de <strong>automação</strong> permitem otimizar o atendimento, desde o <strong>onboarding de novos clientes</strong> até o acompanhamento pós-venda.</p>

<h4 class="zw-paragraph heading4" data-header="4" data-margin-bottom="15.96pt" data-margin-top="15.96pt" data-hd-info="4" data-line-height="1.2">Dicas para Um Atendimento Eficiente:<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocfp32vjyf7vw5&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_wor3r2qtysjg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_wor3r2qtysjg"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocfp32vjyf7vw5&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_wor3r2qtysjg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_wor3r2qtysjg"> </span></h4>
