<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="14041620" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;14041620&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Onboarding automatizado</strong>: Utilize vídeos tutoriais, e-mails automáticos e guias de boas-vindas para integrar novos clientes de forma eficiente.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="14041620" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;14041620&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Crie uma base de conhecimento</strong>: Responda às perguntas mais frequentes dos clientes por meio de uma biblioteca de FAQs, reduzindo a necessidade de suporte contínuo.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="14041620" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;14041620&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Use comunicação automatizada</strong>: Configure lembretes e atualizações automáticas para manter seus clientes sempre informados sobre o progresso do projeto.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="zw-paragraph heading2" data-header="2" data-margin-bottom="14.94pt" data-margin-top="14.94pt" data-hd-info="2" data-line-height="1.2">Estratégias para Automatizar e Escalar seu Negócio de Consultoria<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocsq8isilmtxs8&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_qdz349kat7d9&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_qdz349kat7d9"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocsq8isilmtxs8&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_qdz349kat7d9&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_qdz349kat7d9"> </span></h2>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">A <strong>automação</strong> é o principal fator que permite escalar seu negócio de consultoria sem precisar aumentar significativamente sua equipe. Automação e ferramentas digitais ajudam a gerenciar vários clientes ao mesmo tempo, mantendo o foco na entrega de valor e economizando tempo.</p>

<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading3" data-header="3" data-margin-bottom="14.04pt" data-margin-top="14.04pt" data-hd-info="3" data-line-height="1.2">Automatizando Processos<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocp982krborr4o&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_55j2o0j4clrg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_55j2o0j4clrg"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocp982krborr4o&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_55j2o0j4clrg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_55j2o0j4clrg"> </span></h3>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">A <strong>automação de processos</strong> rotineiros economiza tempo e recursos, permitindo que você se concentre em atividades de maior valor, como o <a href="https://orbitgestao.com.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener">planejamento estratégico</a> e o desenvolvimento de novos serviços. A automação também melhora a eficiência, reduzindo o risco de erros humanos.</p>

<h4 class="zw-paragraph heading4" data-header="4" data-margin-bottom="15.96pt" data-margin-top="15.96pt" data-hd-info="4" data-line-height="1.2">Exemplos de Processos a Automatizar:<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tockb86l29eaaev&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_7gssv7keh7kl&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_7gssv7keh7kl"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tockb86l29eaaev&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_7gssv7keh7kl&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_7gssv7keh7kl"> </span></h4>
