 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="86058690" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;86058690&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Gestão de Projetos</strong>: Use softwares de gestão de projetos para criar cronogramas e atribuir tarefas, garantindo que as entregas sejam feitas no prazo.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="86058690" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;86058690&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Comunicação com Clientes</strong>: Configure e-mails automáticos para lembretes de <a href="/blog/transforme-reunioes-em-resultados-estrategicos-sem-perder-tempo-com-tarefas-repetitivas">reuniões</a>, notificações de progresso e envio de relatórios.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="86058690" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;86058690&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Faturamento e Relatórios</strong>: Automatize o envio de faturas e a geração de relatórios financeiros e operacionais.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading3" data-header="3" data-margin-bottom="14.04pt" data-margin-top="14.04pt" data-hd-info="3" data-line-height="1.2">Gerenciamento de Projetos Digitalmente<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Toc85270eeqpoq0&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_hzgxplu8oo3m&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_hzgxplu8oo3m"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Toc85270eeqpoq0&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_hzgxplu8oo3m&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_hzgxplu8oo3m"> </span></h3>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Gerenciar vários projetos simultaneamente pode ser desafiador, mas com o uso das ferramentas certas, é possível acompanhar o progresso de cada cliente sem perder o controle. Softwares de gestão de projetos como <strong>Evolutto</strong> permitem a criação de <strong>cronogramas detalhados, checklists</strong> e <strong>atualizações automáticas</strong>, facilitando a comunicação e organização.</p>

<h4 class="zw-paragraph heading4" data-header="4" data-margin-bottom="15.96pt" data-margin-top="15.96pt" data-hd-info="4" data-line-height="1.2">Estratégias para uma Gestão de Projetos Eficiente:<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocamfk6eqlxm8z&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_p00t8qfhva1d&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_p00t8qfhva1d"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocamfk6eqlxm8z&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_p00t8qfhva1d&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_p00t8qfhva1d"> </span></h4>
<ul data-list-id="49141569" data-list-format="{&quot;level5&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:8,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level4&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:7,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level7&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:7,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level6&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:6,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level8&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:8,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level1&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:7,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level0&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:6,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level3&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:6,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level2&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:8,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1}}" data-spl-bullet-format="{}">
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="49141569" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;49141569&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Divida os projetos em fases</strong>: Organize o trabalho em etapas menores e mais gerenciáveis. Defina prazos claros para cada uma.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="49141569" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;49141569&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Notificações automáticas</strong>: Notifique automaticamente seus clientes sobre o progresso dos projetos.</p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p class="zw-list zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-left="0.5in" data-text-indent="-0.25in" data-margin-bottom="0pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2" data-list-id="49141569" data-list-info="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;49141569&quot;,&quot;l&quot;:0}"><strong>Use dashboards</strong>: Dashboards visuais permitem acompanhar o andamento de várias tarefas e ajustar a equipe conforme necessário.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading3" data-header="3" data-margin-bottom="14.04pt" data-margin-top="14.04pt" data-hd-info="3" data-line-height="1.2">De Projetos a Produtos Escaláveis<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocwtfvyez8f0o3&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_n7uljgrcuyu1&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_n7uljgrcuyu1"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocwtfvyez8f0o3&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_n7uljgrcuyu1&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_n7uljgrcuyu1"> </span></h3>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Transformar seus serviços de consultoria em<strong> produtos digitais escaláveis</strong> é uma maneira poderosa de expandir sua receita sem precisar aumentar proporcionalmente o número de horas trabalhadas. Ao criar produtos como <strong>cursos online, ebooks</strong> ou <strong>ferramentas digitais</strong>, você pode vender o mesmo serviço para vários clientes, sem a necessidade de envolvimento constante.</p>

<h4 class="zw-paragraph heading4" data-header="4" data-margin-bottom="15.96pt" data-margin-top="15.96pt" data-hd-info="4" data-line-height="1.2">Exemplos de Produtos Escaláveis:<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Toc6170yvx8r5wh&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_dt5qes8ynmue&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_dt5qes8ynmue"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Toc6170yvx8r5wh&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_dt5qes8ynmue&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_dt5qes8ynmue"> </span></h4>
