<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading3" data-header="3" data-margin-bottom="14.04pt" data-margin-top="14.04pt" data-hd-info="3" data-line-height="1.2">Ferramentas para Coletar Feedback<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Toci8n9s7j7zj4z&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_k5krvv38arn8&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;render_type&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;geo_transformation&quot;:{&quot;translation&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;scaling&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:false,&quot;y&quot;:false},&quot;rotation&quot;:false}}" data-bookmark-id="toc_k5krvv38arn8"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Toci8n9s7j7zj4z&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_k5krvv38arn8&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_k5krvv38arn8"> </span></h3>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">Coletar <strong>feedback contínuo</strong> dos clientes é uma maneira eficaz de medir a satisfação e identificar áreas de melhoria. <strong>Pesquisas de satisfação</strong> automatizadas e questionários pós-projeto ajudam a garantir que você está no caminho certo e a melhorar continuamente seus serviços.</p>

